msgstr "用 Docker 快速开始"

#: ../developer/installation.md:30
msgid ""
"Now edit `.env`. **`make up` aborts before starting anything unless these"
" three have values** — `deploy/docker/docker-compose.yml` declares them "
"with Compose's `:?` required form, and Compose fails at interpolation, "
"not at runtime:"
msgstr ""
"接下来编辑 `.env`。**这三个变量没有值时，`make up` 会在启动任何东西之前中止**——`deploy/docker/docker-"
"compose.yml` 用 Compose 的 `:?` 必填写法声明了它们，而 Compose 是在变量插值阶段失败，不是在运行时："

