#: ../developer/installation.md:187
msgid "Provider credentials"
msgstr "Provider 凭据"

#: ../developer/installation.md:189
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"There is no fixed list of provider variables in the code. A model "
"registry substitutes any value that is exactly `${VAR}` when it is "
"loaded, so the provider credentials a deployment needs are exactly the "
"variables its own registry names. Note the registry's expander is the "
"narrow one: whole values only, with no `${VAR:-default}` and no "
"substitution inside a longer string. See "
"[Configuration](configuration.md) for the difference from the routing "
"file."
msgstr ""
"代码里没有一份固定的 provider 变量清单。模型注册表在加载时，只会替换整个值恰好是 `${VAR}` 的那些项，所以一个部署需要哪些 "
"provider 凭据，完全取决于它自己的注册表写了哪些变量。注意注册表用的是那个更窄的展开器：只认整值，不支持 "
"`${VAR:-default}`，也不支持嵌在更长字符串里替换。它和路由文件的差别见[配置](configuration.md)。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:204
msgid ""
"`.env.example` ships blank placeholders for the providers this project "
"has adapters or examples for; add your own names freely. The bundled "
"default registry needs only `OPENROUTER_API_KEY`."
msgstr ""
"`.env.example` 为本项目有 adapter 或示例的那些 provider "
"提供了空白占位；你也可以随意添加自己的变量名。内置的默认注册表只需要 `OPENROUTER_API_KEY`。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:208
msgid ""
"Once a database is configured, keys can also be added from the admin "
"console (**Providers → Keys**) with no restart; they join the same pool "
"as the keys the registry names. See [Runtime configuration from the admin"
" console](configuration.md#runtime-configuration-from-the-admin-console)."
msgstr "配置了数据库之后，key 也可以不重启就从管理控制台（**Providers → Keys**）添加；它们会进入注册表指名的那些 key 所在的同一个池子。见[从管理控制台做运行时配置](configuration.md#runtime-configuration-from-the-admin-console)。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:213
msgid "Where the config files live"
msgstr "配置文件在哪里"

#: ../developer/installation.md:215
msgid ""
"There is no `config/models.yaml` or `config/routing.yaml` in this "
"repository. `resolve_config_path` in "
"`apps/backend/serving/config/distribution.py` resolves each config file "
"in this order:"
msgstr ""
"本仓库里没有 `config/models.yaml`，也没有 "
"`config/routing.yaml`。`apps/backend/serving/config/distribution.py` 里的 "
"`resolve_config_path` 按以下顺序解析每个配置文件："

#: ../developer/installation.md:219
msgid ""
"**an explicit environment variable** — `MODELS_CONFIG_PATH`, "
"`ROUTING_CONFIG_PATH`, `ALERTS_CONFIG_PATH` (the older `MODELS_CONFIG` "
"and `ROUTING_CONFIG` spellings are still accepted; the `*_CONFIG_PATH` "
"name wins when both are set);"
msgstr ""
"**显式的环境变量**——`MODELS_CONFIG_PATH`、`ROUTING_CONFIG_PATH`、`ALERTS_CONFIG_PATH`（旧的"
" `MODELS_CONFIG` 和 `ROUTING_CONFIG` 写法仍然接受；两者都设置时以 `*_CONFIG_PATH` 为准）；"

#: ../developer/installation.md:223
msgid ""
"**a distribution manifest** — `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` pointing at a "
"`distributions/<name>/distribution.yaml`, whose `paths:` section names "
"the files. The manifest only takes effect with "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE=active`; the default `dark` loads and validates"
" it and logs what it *would* change while resolution stays as it was;"
msgstr ""
"**distribution manifest**——`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` 指向某个 "
"`distributions/<name>/distribution.yaml`，其中的 `paths:` 一节点名了各个文件。该 "
"manifest 只在 `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE=active` 时才生效；默认的 `dark` "
"只加载并校验它、记录它*本来会*改动什么，而解析结果保持原样；"

#: ../developer/installation.md:228
msgid ""
"**the built-in defaults** — `config/examples/models.openrouter.yaml` and "
"`config/examples/routing.minimal.yaml`. There is no default alerts file, "
"and its absence means the built-in thresholds apply."
msgstr ""
"**内置默认值**——`config/examples/models.openrouter.yaml` 和 "
"`config/examples/routing.minimal.yaml`。没有默认的告警文件，它的缺席意味着内置阈值生效。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:232
msgid ""
"Paths are relative to the working directory (`/app` in the container). "
"The Compose file mounts both `config/` and `distributions/` read-only "
"into the backend, so editing either on the host and restarting the "
"backend is enough — no image rebuild."
msgstr ""
"路径相对于工作目录（容器里是 `/app`）。Compose 文件把 `config/` 和 `distributions/` 都以只读方式挂进 "
"backend，所以在宿主机上改动其中任意一个再重启 backend 就够了——不必重新构建镜像。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:237
msgid ""
"See [Configuration](configuration.md) for what goes *inside* those files,"
" and [Quickstart](router-tutorial.md) for a worked overlay."
msgstr ""
"这些文件*里面*该写什么，见[配置](configuration.md)；一个完整走通的 overlay 示例见[快速开始](router-"
"tutorial.md)。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:241
msgid ""
"A backend running directly on the host can reach a host inference server "
"through `localhost`. A backend in Docker must use a Docker-reachable "
"address such as `host.docker.internal`, written explicitly in the model "
"registry; HybridInference does not rewrite provider URLs."
msgstr ""
"直接跑在宿主机上的 backend 可以通过 `localhost` 访问宿主机上的推理服务器。而 Docker 里的 backend 必须用 "
"Docker 能访问到的地址，例如 `host.docker.internal`，并在模型注册表里显式写出来；HybridInference "
"不会改写 provider 的 URL。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:247
msgid "Verifying the install"
msgstr "验证安装"

#: ../developer/installation.md:256
msgid "End to end, against a running gateway:"
msgstr "对着运行中的网关做一次端到端验证："

#: ../developer/installation.md:267
msgid ""
"Drop the `Authorization` header if you set `USER_AUTH_ENABLED=0`. Use a "
"model id that `/v1/models` actually listed."
msgstr ""
"如果设了 `USER_AUTH_ENABLED=0`，就去掉 `Authorization` 头。模型 id 要用 `/v1/models` "
"真的列出来的那些。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:270
msgid ""
"The same call from the OpenAI Python SDK — the gateway is the `base_url`,"
" and nothing else about an existing client changes:"
msgstr "同一个调用，用 OpenAI 的 Python SDK 来发——网关就是那个 `base_url`，现有客户端别的什么都不用改："

#: ../developer/installation.md:285
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "文档"

#: ../developer/installation.md:287
msgid ""
"These developer docs are MyST Markdown built with Sphinx from "
"`docs/developer/`. Building them locally and the checks that gate them "
"are covered in [Contributing](contributing.md#documentation)."
msgstr ""
"这份开发者文档是 MyST Markdown，由 Sphinx 从 `docs/developer/` "
"构建。本地构建方式以及为其把关的检查，见[贡献指南](contributing.md#documentation)。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:291
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../developer/installation.md:293
msgid ""
"**`required variable DB_USER is missing a value: DB_USER must be set in "
".env file`** — Compose stopped at interpolation. Fill in `DB_USER` and "
"`DB_PASSWORD` in `.env`; see the table above."
msgstr ""
"**`required variable DB_USER is missing a value: DB_USER must be set in "
".env file`**——Compose 在变量插值阶段就停了。在 `.env` 里填上 `DB_USER` 和 "
"`DB_PASSWORD`，见上面的表格。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:297
msgid ""
"**`env file ... .env not found`** — the backend service reads "
"`../../.env` relative to `deploy/docker/`, i.e. `.env` at the repository "
"root. `cp .env.example .env` before `make up`."
msgstr ""
"**`env file ... .env not found`**——backend 服务读的是相对 `deploy/docker/` 的 "
"`../../.env`，也就是仓库根目录的 `.env`。在 `make up` 之前先 `cp .env.example .env`。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:301
msgid ""
"**Import errors when running from source** — run from the repository root"
" with `PYTHONPATH=apps/backend`, and make sure the virtualenv is active "
"(or use `uv run`)."
msgstr ""
"**从源码运行时报导入错误**——请在仓库根目录、带上 `PYTHONPATH=apps/backend` 运行，并确认虚拟环境已激活（或改用 "
"`uv run`）。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:305
msgid ""
"**Every request 404s with an empty `/v1/models`** — the registry loaded "
"nothing. On startup the backend logs either `Registered N routes from "
"<path>` or an error naming the registry path it could not find; compare "
"that path against the precedence list above."
msgstr ""
"**所有请求都 404，且 `/v1/models` 为空**——说明注册表什么都没加载进来。启动时 backend 要么打印 "
"`Registered N routes from "
"<path>`，要么打印一条指出它找不到的注册表路径的错误；把那个路径和上面的优先级列表对一下。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:310
msgid ""
"**Port already in use** — override `BACKEND_PORT`, `FRONTEND_PORT` or "
"`DB_PORT` in `.env`."
msgstr "**端口已被占用**——在 `.env` 里覆盖 `BACKEND_PORT`、`FRONTEND_PORT` 或 `DB_PORT`。"

