#: ../../claude/worktree/public-developer-readiness/docs/developer/installation.md:0
msgid "`127.0.0.1:3001`"
msgstr "`127.0.0.1:3001`"

#: ../../claude/worktree/public-developer-readiness/docs/developer/installation.md:85
msgid ""
"These ports are reachable from the host by default. A reverse proxy on the "
"same host can use the loopback address; access from another machine "
"requires an explicit host override. See [Deployment Guide](deployment.md) "
"before exposing the console, which also forwards API requests."
msgstr ""
"这些端口默认可从宿主机访问。同机运行的反向代理可以使用回环地址；从其他机器访问则需要显式覆盖监听地址。控制台也会转发 API "
"请求，公开它之前请先阅读[部署指南](deployment.md)。"

#: ../../claude/worktree/public-developer-readiness/docs/developer/installation.md:90
msgid "pgAdmin is in the Compose file too, behind the optional `admin` profile."
msgstr "Compose 文件中也包含 pgAdmin，通过可选的 `admin` profile 启动。"

#: ../../claude/worktree/public-developer-readiness/docs/developer/installation.md:151
msgid ""
"Open `http://localhost:3001`. The explicit backend URL makes the console's "
"API proxy reach the gateway running on the host. Its default, "
"`http://backend:8080`, is a Docker network address; the frontend process "
"does not load the repository root's `.env`. Reuse the override whenever you"
" start the console, and adjust the port if your backend uses a different "
"one. Check the complete proxy path with `curl "
"http://localhost:3001/health`."
msgstr ""
"打开 `http://localhost:3001`。显式指定后端 URL 后，控制台的 API 代理才能访问宿主机上运行的网关。默认值 "
"`http://backend:8080` 是 Docker 网络地址；前端进程不会加载仓库根目录的 "
"`.env`。每次启动控制台时都要带上这个覆盖值；如果后端使用其他端口，也应相应修改。用 `curl "
"http://localhost:3001/health` 检查完整代理链路。"

#: ../../claude/worktree/public-developer-readiness/docs/developer/installation.md:166
msgid ""
"For a local gateway without accounts or a database, set both "
"`DB_ENABLED=false` and `USER_AUTH_ENABLED=false` in `.env`. It still routes"
" requests, and `/health` reports `\"database_configured\": false`. "
"Accounts, API keys and request history need the database and both "
"authentication secrets."
msgstr ""
"如果本地网关不需要账户或数据库，在 `.env` 中同时设置 `DB_ENABLED=false` 和 "
"`USER_AUTH_ENABLED=false`。它仍能路由请求，`/health` 会报告 `\"database_configured\": "
"false`。账户、API key 和请求历史需要数据库及两个认证密钥。"
